%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
/s { length r } def
/e { stopped b } def
3 array s 3 array 0 get null eq b 0 array s 5 string s 5 string 0 get r
1 2 3 3 packedarray s 1 2 3 3 packedarray type /packedarraytype eq b
(hello) length r /name length r 4 dict length r
{ -1 array } e { 1.5 array } e { (x) string } e { 5 length } e { 1 maxlength } e
